{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33165","headline":"卖花者 · 司马扎","name":"卖花者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少壮彼何人，种花荒苑外。\n不知力田苦，却笑耕耘辈。\n当春卖春色，来往经几代。\n长安甲第多，处处花堪爱。\n良金不惜费，竞取园中最。\n一蕊才占烟，歌声已高会。\n自言种花地，终日拥轩盖。\n农夫官役时，独与花相对。\n那令卖花者，久爲生人害。\n贵粟不贵花，生人自应泰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}